{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>教宗良十四世將於明日入院，準備做手術。</p><p></p><p>71歲的教宗，近日接受身體檢查期間，發現肺部有一處較細小，處於早期、尚未擴散的結節。</p><p></p><p>教廷表示，教宗將於當地周二上午入院，準備接受切除結節手術，預計手術後的住院時間為一星期左右。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T15:19:45.352130+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T19:38:07.862995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T15:18:14.274229+00:00","content_hash":"fb478102439200f8c4d4597bbeb07cdbdd0b88b5a27ac00b7e8f2c4cebf8175a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}